    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloomcraft is a Garden Creation Simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's goal is to create a garden that pleases the Flower Queen.<br>The more the Flower Queen likes the garden, the more money she pays for it every second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money can be used to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new flower types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossbreed planted flowers to create completely new and unique flower varieties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve garden parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover garden maintenance costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of real-life flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Millions of unpredictable flower varieties from crossbreeding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different garden layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Flower Queens, each with a unique taste in gardens</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bloomcraft is a Garden Creation Simulator.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's goal is to create a garden that pleases the Flower Queen.<br>The more the Flower Queen likes the garden, the more money she pays for it every second.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money can be used to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new flower types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crossbreed planted flowers to create completely new and unique flower varieties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve garden parameters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cover garden maintenance costs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of real-life flowers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Millions of unpredictable flower varieties from crossbreeding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 different garden layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Flower Queens, each with a unique taste in gardens</p></li></ul>",
